---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Perfil y Ajustes de Seguridad · Muntrume Motorsport"
  description="Gestiona tu perfil de miembro del equipo Muntrume Motorsport, sesiones activas de hasta 30 días, Passkeys WebAuthn, Authenticator TOTP y canales MFA 100 % Open Source."
  canonical="https://muntru.me/ajustes/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="mm-set-page">
    <div class="mm-set-wrap">
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <header class="mm-set-head">
        <div class="mm-set-profile-row">
          <div id="setAvatar" class="mm-set-avatar" aria-hidden="true">MM</div>
          <div>
            <div class="mm-set-kicker">MUNTRUME ID · SESIÓN PERSISTENTE HASTA 30 DÍAS</div>
            <h1 id="setTitle">Perfil y Ajustes de Seguridad</h1>
            <p id="setSubtitle" class="mm-set-sub">Cargando perfil del piloto…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mm-set-head-actions">
          <a href="/garage/" class="mm-btn-ghost">Garage Vault</a>
          <a href="https://ai.muntru.me/" class="mm-btn-ghost">Muntrume AI ↗</a>
          <button type="button" id="btnLogoutAll" class="mm-btn-danger">Cerrar sesión</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- LOGIN REQUIRED BANNER (shown only if not logged in) -->
      <section id="setNeedLogin" class="mm-set-card" hidden>
        <h2>Inicia sesión para gestionar tu perfil</h2>
        <p>Necesitas una sesión verificada de miembro de Muntrume Motorsport para administrar tus Passkeys, Authenticator y canales MFA.</p>
        <a href="/login/?next=/ajustes/" class="mm-btn-primary">Ir a iniciar sesión →</a>
      </section>

      <!-- MAIN AUTHED GRID -->
      <div id="setMain" class="mm-set-grid" hidden>
        <!-- STEP-UP IDENTITY VERIFICATION BAR -->
        <section class="mm-set-card mm-set-card--full mm-stepup-card">
          <div class="mm-stepup-top">
            <div>
              <span id="stepupBadge" class="mm-pill mm-pill--warn">BLOQUEADO · CONFIRMACIÓN REQUERIDA</span>
              <h2>Verificación de identidad para cambios de seguridad</h2>
              <p>Antes de añadir o borrar Passkeys, configurar Authenticator o cambiar tus canales MFA, te enviamos un código de 6 dígitos a tu correo (<code>@mail.muntru.me</code>) u otro canal para confirmar que eres tú.</p>
            </div>
            <div id="stepupTimer" class="mm-stepup-timer" hidden>Desbloqueado · 15 min</div>
          </div>

          <div id="stepupControls" class="mm-stepup-controls">
            <select id="stepupChannel" aria-label="Canal de verificación">
              <option value="email">Correo electrónico (recomendado)</option>
              <option value="ntfy">ntfy.sh (Push móvil)</option>
              <option value="discord">Discord DM</option>
              <option value="sms_gateway">Android SMS Gateway</option>
              <option value="whatsapp_oss">WhatsApp self-hosted</option>
            </select>
            <button type="button" id="btnStepupSend" class="mm-btn-primary">Enviar código de confirmación</button>
            <div id="stepupVerifyRow" class="mm-stepup-verify" hidden>
              <input type="text" id="stepupCode" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" placeholder="Código 6 dígitos" />
              <button type="button" id="btnStepupVerify" class="mm-btn-primary">Confirmar identidad</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="setBanner" class="mm-alert" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </section>

        <!-- CARD 1: PROFILE -->
        <section class="mm-set-card">
          <div class="mm-card-kicker">01 · PERFIL DE EQUIPO</div>
          <h2>Datos del miembro</h2>
          <form id="formProfile" class="mm-form">
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Nombre visible en Paddock, Garage y AI Studio</span>
              <input type="text" id="profName" maxlength="80" required />
            </label>
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Correo autorizado</span>
              <input type="email" id="profEmail" disabled />
            </label>
            <div class="mm-meta-row">
              <div><span>Rol en el equipo</span><strong id="profRole">—</strong></div>
              <div><span>Duración de sesión</span><strong>30 días activa</strong></div>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" id="btnSaveProfile" class="mm-btn-primary">Guardar perfil</button>
          </form>
        </section>

        <!-- CARD 2: PASSKEYS -->
        <section class="mm-set-card">
          <div class="mm-card-kicker">02 · PASSKEYS (FIDO2 / WEBAUTHN)</div>
          <h2>Acceso en 1 toque sin contraseña</h2>
          <p class="mm-card-desc">Registra Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID o una llave física. Requiere confirmación previa arriba.</p>

          <div id="passkeysList" class="mm-pk-list"></div>

          <div class="mm-pk-add">
            <input type="text" id="pkDeviceName" maxlength="60" placeholder="Nombre (ej. PC Simulador, iPhone Alberto)" />
            <button type="button" id="btnAddPasskey" class="mm-btn-primary">+ Añadir Passkey</button>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CARD 3: AUTHENTICATOR TOTP -->
        <section class="mm-set-card">
          <div class="mm-card-kicker">03 · APP AUTHENTICATOR (TOTP RFC 6238)</div>
          <h2>Códigos de 6 dígitos y recuperación</h2>
          <p class="mm-card-desc">Compatible con Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, Ente Auth, Aegis o Bitwarden. Permite iniciar sesión sin contraseña.</p>

          <div class="mm-status-line">
            <span>Estado actual:</span>
            <strong id="totpStateBadge" class="mm-pill">Inactivo</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="mm-btn-row">
            <button type="button" id="btnTotpSetup" class="mm-btn-primary">Configurar Authenticator</button>
            <button type="button" id="btnTotpDisable" class="mm-btn-danger" hidden>Desactivar TOTP</button>
          </div>

          <div id="totpSetupBox" class="mm-totp-box" hidden>
            <p><strong>1.</strong> Añade esta clave en tu app Authenticator:</p>
            <code id="totpSecretVal" class="mm-secret-code"></code>
            <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>2.</strong> Guarda estos <strong>8 códigos de recuperación</strong> de un solo uso:</p>
            <pre id="totpRecoveryVal" class="mm-recovery-grid"></pre>
            <div class="mm-pk-add" style="margin-top:12px">
              <input type="text" id="totpConfirmCode" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" placeholder="Código de 6 dígitos" />
              <button type="button" id="btnTotpConfirm" class="mm-btn-primary">Activar Authenticator</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CARD 4: OPEN SOURCE OTP CHANNELS -->
        <section class="mm-set-card">
          <div class="mm-card-kicker">04 · CANALES MFA 100 % OPEN SOURCE</div>
          <h2>ntfy.sh, Discord DM, SMS Gateway y WhatsApp</h2>
          <p class="mm-card-desc">Configura tus canales gratuitos para recibir códigos OTP al iniciar sesión o confirmar cambios de seguridad.</p>

          <form id="formChannels" class="mm-form">
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Canal preferido</span>
              <select id="chPreferred">
                <option value="ntfy">ntfy.sh (Push móvil 0 €)</option>
                <option value="discord">Discord DM (Bot MMT)</option>
                <option value="sms_gateway">Android SMS Gateway (SMS propio)</option>
                <option value="whatsapp_oss">WhatsApp self-hosted (Evolution / WAHA)</option>
                <option value="email">Correo electrónico</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Canal privado ntfy.sh</span>
              <div class="mm-pk-add">
                <input type="text" id="chNtfy" placeholder="Se genera automáticamente" />
                <button type="button" id="btnGenNtfy" class="mm-btn-ghost">Generar</button>
              </div>
              <small id="chNtfyHint" class="mm-hint"></small>
            </label>
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Discord User ID (opcional, para DM)</span>
              <input type="text" id="chDiscord" placeholder="Ej. 123456789012345678" />
            </label>
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Teléfono internacional (SMS Gateway / WhatsApp OSS)</span>
              <input type="tel" id="chPhone" placeholder="+34600111222" />
            </label>
            <button type="submit" id="btnSaveChannels" class="mm-btn-primary">Guardar canales MFA</button>
          </form>
        </section>

        <!-- CARD 5: PASSWORD -->
        <section class="mm-set-card mm-set-card--full">
          <div class="mm-card-kicker">05 · CONTRASEÑA DE RESPALDO</div>
          <h2>Cambiar contraseña</h2>
          <form id="formChangePw" class="mm-pw-grid">
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Contraseña actual</span>
              <input type="password" id="curPw" autocomplete="current-password" required />
            </label>
            <label class="mm-field">
              <span>Nueva contraseña (mínimo 10 caracteres)</span>
              <input type="password" id="newPw" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" required />
            </label>
            <div class="mm-pw-submit">
              <button type="submit" id="btnChangePw" class="mm-btn-primary">Actualizar contraseña</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var API = "https://muntrume.atrumin16.workers.dev";
      var token = "";
      try { token = localStorage.getItem("mrt_vault_token") || localStorage.getItem("mm_token") || ""; } catch (e) {}
      var stepupToken = "";
      var stepupExpiresAt = 0;

      var banner = document.getElementById("setBanner");
      function notify(msg, type) {
        if (!banner) return;
        if (!msg) { banner.hidden = true; return; }
        banner.textContent = msg;
        banner.className = "mm-alert mm-alert--" + (type || "info");
        banner.hidden = false;
      }

      async function apiCall(path, method, body) {
        var headers = { "Content-Type": "application/json", "Authorization": "Bearer " + token };
        if (stepupToken && Date.now() < stepupExpiresAt) headers["X-Stepup-Token"] = stepupToken;
        var res = await fetch(API + path, {
          method: method || "POST",
          headers: headers,
          body: method === "GET" ? undefined : JSON.stringify(body || {})
        });
        var data = await res.json().catch(function () { return {}; });
        if (!res.ok || data.success === false) {
          var err = new Error(data.error || ("HTTP " + res.status));
          err.code = data.code || "";
          throw err;
        }
        return data;
      }

      function b64uToBytes(s) {
        var b = String(s).replace(/-/g, "+").replace(/_/g, "/");
        var bin = atob(b + "===".slice((b.length + 3) % 4));
        var arr = new Uint8Array(bin.length);
        for (var i = 0; i < bin.length; i++) arr[i] = bin.charCodeAt(i);
        return arr;
      }
      function bytesToB64u(buf) {
        var arr = new Uint8Array(buf);
        var s = "";
        for (var i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) s += String.fromCharCode(arr[i]);
        return btoa(s).replace(/\+/g, "-").replace(/\//g, "_").replace(/=+$/, "");
      }

      function paintStepup() {
        var ok = Boolean(stepupToken && Date.now() < stepupExpiresAt);
        var badge = document.getElementById("stepupBadge");
        var timer = document.getElementById("stepupTimer");
        if (badge) {
          badge.textContent = ok ? "IDENTIDAD CONFIRMADA · AJUSTES DESBLOQUEADOS" : "BLOQUEADO · CONFIRMACIÓN REQUERIDA";
          badge.className = "mm-pill " + (ok ? "mm-pill--ok" : "mm-pill--warn");
        }
        if (timer) {
          timer.hidden = !ok;
          if (ok) {
            var mins = Math.max(1, Math.ceil((stepupExpiresAt - Date.now()) / 60000));
            timer.textContent = "Desbloqueado · " + mins + " min restantes";
          }
        }
      }

      function renderPasskeys(list) {
        var box = document.getElementById("passkeysList");
        if (!box) return;
        if (!list || !list.length) {
          box.innerHTML = '<div class="mm-empty">Aún no tienes ninguna Passkey registrada.</div>';
          return;
        }
        box.innerHTML = list.map(function (pk) {
          var created = (pk.created_at || "").slice(0, 10);
          return '<div class="mm-pk-item"><div><strong>' + (pk.device_name || "Passkey") + '</strong><span>Registrada: ' + created + '</span></div><button type="button" class="mm-btn-xs" data-del-pk="' + pk.credential_id + '">Eliminar</button></div>';
        }).join("");
        box.querySelectorAll("[data-del-pk]").forEach(function (btn) {
          btn.addEventListener("click", async function () {
            try {
              await apiCall("/api/auth/passkey/delete", "POST", { credential_id: btn.getAttribute("data-del-pk") });
              notify("Passkey eliminada correctamente.", "ok");
              loadAll();
            } catch (err) {
              notify(err.message, "error");
            }
          });
        });
      }

      async function loadAll() {
        if (!token) {
          document.getElementById("setNeedLogin").hidden = false;
          document.getElementById("setSubtitle").textContent = "Sesión no iniciada.";
          return;
        }
        try {
          var st = await apiCall("/api/auth/mfa/status", "GET");
          var storedUser = {};
          try { storedUser = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("mrt_vault_user") || "{}"); } catch (e) {}
          var name = storedUser.name || st.email.split("@")[0];
          var initials = name.split(/\s+/).map(function (w) { return w[0] || ""; }).join("").slice(0, 2).toUpperCase() || "MM";
          document.getElementById("setAvatar").textContent = initials;
          document.getElementById("setSubtitle").textContent = name + " · " + st.email;
          document.getElementById("profName").value = name;
          document.getElementById("profEmail").value = st.email;
          document.getElementById("profRole").textContent = (storedUser.role || "piloto").toUpperCase();

          renderPasskeys(st.passkeys || []);
          var totpBadge = document.getElementById("totpStateBadge");
          totpBadge.textContent = st.totp_enabled ? "Activo (TOTP RFC 6238)" : "Inactivo";
          totpBadge.className = "mm-pill " + (st.totp_enabled ? "mm-pill--ok" : "");
          document.getElementById("btnTotpDisable").hidden = !st.totp_enabled;

          var ch = st.channels || {};
          document.getElementById("chPreferred").value = ch.preferred || "ntfy";
          document.getElementById("chNtfy").value = ch.ntfy_topic || "";
          document.getElementById("chNtfyHint").textContent = ch.ntfy_topic ? ("Suscríbete en la app ntfy a: https://ntfy.sh/" + ch.ntfy_topic) : "";
          document.getElementById("chDiscord").value = ch.discord_user_id || "";
          document.getElementById("chPhone").value = ch.phone || "";

          document.getElementById("setMain").hidden = false;
          paintStepup();
        } catch (err) {
          document.getElementById("setNeedLogin").hidden = false;
          document.getElementById("setSubtitle").textContent = "Tu sesión ha caducado. Vuelve a iniciar sesión.";
        }
      }

      // Step-up send & verify
      document.getElementById("btnStepupSend")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        var ch = document.getElementById("stepupChannel").value;
        notify("Enviando código de confirmación por " + ch + "…", "info");
        try {
          await apiCall("/api/auth/security/stepup/send", "POST", { channel: ch });
          document.getElementById("stepupVerifyRow").hidden = false;
          notify("Código enviado por " + ch + ". Introdúcelo para desbloquear los ajustes durante 15 min.", "ok");
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      document.getElementById("btnStepupVerify")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        var code = (document.getElementById("stepupCode").value || "").trim();
        try {
          var r = await apiCall("/api/auth/security/stepup/verify", "POST", { code: code });
          stepupToken = r.stepup_token;
          stepupExpiresAt = Date.now() + (r.expires_in || 900) * 1000;
          document.getElementById("stepupVerifyRow").hidden = true;
          document.getElementById("stepupCode").value = "";
          paintStepup();
          notify("Identidad confirmada. Ya puedes añadir Passkeys, configurar Authenticator o guardar canales MFA.", "ok");
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      // Profile update
      document.getElementById("formProfile")?.addEventListener("submit", async function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        var name = (document.getElementById("profName").value || "").trim();
        try {
          var r = await apiCall("/api/auth/profile/update", "POST", { name: name });
          if (r.user) localStorage.setItem("mrt_vault_user", JSON.stringify(r.user));
          notify("Perfil actualizado.", "ok");
          loadAll();
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      // Add Passkey
      document.getElementById("btnAddPasskey")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        if (!window.PublicKeyCredential) { notify("Este navegador no soporta Passkeys.", "error"); return; }
        var dev = (document.getElementById("pkDeviceName").value || "Passkey Muntrume").trim();
        try {
          var optsRes = await apiCall("/api/auth/passkey/register/options", "POST", {});
          var opts = optsRes.options;
          opts.challenge = b64uToBytes(opts.challenge);
          opts.user.id = b64uToBytes(opts.user.id);
          if (Array.isArray(opts.excludeCredentials)) {
            opts.excludeCredentials = opts.excludeCredentials.map(function (c) {
              return Object.assign({}, c, { id: b64uToBytes(c.id) });
            });
          }
          var cred = await navigator.credentials.create({ publicKey: opts });
          if (!cred) throw new Error("Registro cancelado.");
          var spki = cred.response.getPublicKey ? cred.response.getPublicKey() : null;
          if (!spki) throw new Error("Tu navegador no expone getPublicKey() SPKI.");
          await apiCall("/api/auth/passkey/register/verify", "POST", {
            credential_id: cred.id,
            public_key_spki: bytesToB64u(spki),
            client_data_json: bytesToB64u(cred.response.clientDataJSON),
            device_name: dev
          });
          document.getElementById("pkDeviceName").value = "";
          notify("Passkey registrada correctamente. Ya puedes iniciar sesión en 1 toque.", "ok");
          loadAll();
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      // TOTP Setup / Confirm / Disable
      document.getElementById("btnTotpSetup")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        try {
          var r = await apiCall("/api/auth/mfa/totp/setup", "POST", {});
          document.getElementById("totpSecretVal").textContent = r.secret;
          document.getElementById("totpRecoveryVal").textContent = (r.recovery_codes || []).join("\n");
          document.getElementById("totpSetupBox").hidden = false;
          notify("Añade la clave a tu app Authenticator y confirma con el código de 6 dígitos.", "info");
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      document.getElementById("btnTotpConfirm")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        var code = (document.getElementById("totpConfirmCode").value || "").trim();
        try {
          await apiCall("/api/auth/mfa/totp/verify", "POST", { code: code });
          document.getElementById("totpSetupBox").hidden = true;
          notify("Authenticator TOTP activado. Ya puedes iniciar sesión sin contraseña desde /login/.", "ok");
          loadAll();
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      document.getElementById("btnTotpDisable")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        var code = prompt("Introduce el código actual de 6 dígitos de tu Authenticator para desactivarlo:");
        if (!code) return;
        try {
          await apiCall("/api/auth/mfa/totp/disable", "POST", { code: code });
          notify("Authenticator TOTP desactivado.", "ok");
          loadAll();
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      // Open-Source MFA channels
      document.getElementById("btnGenNtfy")?.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        try {
          var r = await apiCall("/api/auth/mfa/channels/save", "POST", { generate_ntfy: true, preferred_channel: "ntfy" });
          document.getElementById("chNtfy").value = r.ntfy_topic || "";
          document.getElementById("chNtfyHint").textContent = r.ntfy_subscribe_url ? ("Suscríbete en la app ntfy a: " + r.ntfy_subscribe_url) : "";
          notify("Canal privado ntfy generado y guardado.", "ok");
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      document.getElementById("formChannels")?.addEventListener("submit", async function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        try {
          var r = await apiCall("/api/auth/mfa/channels/save", "POST", {
            preferred_channel: document.getElementById("chPreferred").value,
            ntfy_topic: (document.getElementById("chNtfy").value || "").trim(),
            discord_user_id: (document.getElementById("chDiscord").value || "").trim(),
            phone: (document.getElementById("chPhone").value || "").trim()
          });
          notify("Canales MFA Open Source guardados.", "ok");
          if (r.ntfy_subscribe_url) document.getElementById("chNtfyHint").textContent = "Suscríbete en la app ntfy a: " + r.ntfy_subscribe_url;
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      // Password change
      document.getElementById("formChangePw")?.addEventListener("submit", async function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        try {
          await apiCall("/api/setups/change-password", "POST", {
            currentPassword: document.getElementById("curPw").value,
            newPassword: document.getElementById("newPw").value
          });
          document.getElementById("curPw").value = "";
          document.getElementById("newPw").value = "";
          notify("Contraseña actualizada correctamente.", "ok");
        } catch (err) { notify(err.message, "error"); }
      });

      // Logout
      document.getElementById("btnLogoutAll")?.addEventListener("click", function () {
        try {
          localStorage.removeItem("mrt_vault_token");
          localStorage.removeItem("mm_token");
          localStorage.removeItem("mrt_vault_user");
        } catch (e) {}
        location.href = "/login/";
      });

      loadAll();
    })();
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
  .mm-set-page { min-height: 100vh; padding: 92px 20px 80px; background: var(--r-bg); color: var(--r-text); }
  .mm-set-wrap { max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .mm-set-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 26px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--r-line); }
  .mm-set-profile-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
  .mm-set-avatar { width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 16px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--r-accent, #10b981) 18%, var(--r-surface)); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--r-accent, #10b981) 45%, var(--r-line)); color: var(--r-accent, #10b981); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 800 20px/1 var(--r-sans, system-ui); }
  .mm-set-kicker { font: 700 10.5px/1 var(--r-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--r-accent, #10b981); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .mm-set-head h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.025em; text-transform: none; }
  .mm-set-sub { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--r-muted); }
  .mm-set-head-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }

  .mm-set-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .mm-set-card { background: var(--r-surface); border: 1px solid var(--r-line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 24px; }
  .mm-set-card--full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .mm-stepup-card { border-left: 3px solid var(--r-accent, #10b981); }
  .mm-card-kicker { font: 700 10.5px/1 var(--r-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); color: var(--r-accent, #10b981); letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .mm-set-card h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--r-text); text-transform: none; }
